hidden acceptance tests decide whether it did. Measures tokens, turns, wall time and success per
arm, and how the agent navigated (graph calls against grep, glob and file reads).

    bench/agent-loop/change-tasks --list
    bench/agent-loop/change-tasks --task petclinic-owner-email --arm jk --runs 1
    bench/agent-loop/change-tasks --arm jk --arm jk-hooks --arm mvn --runs 5
    bench/agent-loop/change-tasks --driver grok --arm jk --arm jk-hooks
